    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Northu">Northu</ref> 2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And Godes forboda we forbeodað, þæt ænig preost oðre cirican naðer ne gebicgæ ne geþicgæ, buton hine hwa mid heafodgilte forwyrce, þæt he weofodpenunge þanon forð wyrðe ne sy.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And by virtue of God's prohibition, we forbid that any priest shall either buy or sell another's church, unless anyone becomes guilty of a capital crime so that he is henceforth unworthy to minister at the altar.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">And because of God's prohibition, we forbid that any priest either buy or accept another's church, unless the other ruins himself with a capital crime so that afterwards he is unworthy to serve at the altar.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
